  "details": "Nvidia recently added the option to enable \"Smooth Motion\" via the Nvidia app for all 40 et 50 series GPUs. I tried enabling it but after launching vrchat, it crashes after around 30 seconds and upon closing EAC complains about rtvcvfw64.dll which as far as I understand is related to Nvidia graphics drivers.\n\nIs it possible to whitelist/add support for this feature? It is supposed to add 1 generated frame between every 2 computed ones. If EAC is the only barrier to support this, it would be awesome for a smooth VRChat experince!",
